":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/contextMenu(menuItems:preview:)":{"title":"contextMenu(menuItems:preview:)","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/contextmenu(menuitems:preview:)","abstract":[],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"contextMenu","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"M","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"P","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"menuItems","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"M","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preview","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"P","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/contextMenu(menuItems:preview:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"code":"Position","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"title":"Interaction_DragView"}}}